  "protocol": [
    "Baseline is the clean merge of PR 52 into PR 55 (which includes PR 54); its built dist was copied before editing the loop builders.",
    "One browser runs at a time. Page query: /v2/?s=chimera&o=gecko&tier=T3 or /v2/?s=textures&o=gecko&tier=T3; Textures starts on spots.",
    "After __growLive: 4 s initial warmup. For each speed: set speed, settle 3 s, measure a discarded 6 s warm sample, clear collected pass timings, measure 6 s.",
    "Frames/s counts non-empty device.queue.submit calls. GPU time comes from the page GpuProfiler timestamp source, nca pass (all dishes together).",
    "The probe copies scheduler.noteUnits(nca,k) into profiler.tag so each asynchronous timestamp carries its own step count as profiler.frameTag; step ms is pass ms / k. It does not change the scheduler costs or the shaders.",
    "p50/p90 are order statistics at floor(p*N), capped at N-1. GPU busy percentage and the 500 MHz clock fraction are polled every 50 ms. Desktop clock variation prevents treating these as saturated pass benchmarks.",
    "Hash runs pause and reload with seed 42. Chimera: gecko + butterfly, scripted graft at step 240, advance to 600, hash each entire Float32 state and Uint32 rule map. Textures: reload each shipped texture, advance 1024, hash all 16 state channels on the 256x256 plane.",
    "Timing and identity before/after isolate the loop rewrite, without the scheduler completion guard. Initial one-rule results are retained below, including incomplete 20-frame results. Final proof runs use the shipped code with the guard and require all 21 frames."
  ],
